WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:03.253
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.336 --> 00:05.130
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.213 --> 00:06.506
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.589 --> 00:08.341
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:08.425 --> 00:11.553
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.636 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.849
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:15.932 --> 00:17.684
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.767 --> 00:19.644
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:19.728 --> 00:21.688
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.732
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:23.815 --> 00:25.859
♪ Then drop on the deck
♪ 然后落在甲板上

00:25.942 --> 00:27.610
-All: Spongebob Squarepants!
-Ready?
-全部：海绵宝宝！
-准备好？

00:27.694 --> 00:29.612
All: Spongebob Squarepants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:29.696 --> 00:31.573
Spongebob Squarepants!
海绵宝宝！

00:31.656 --> 00:33.783
Spongebob Squarepants!
海绵宝宝！

00:33.867 --> 00:34.951
Spongebob
海绵宝宝

00:35.034 --> 00:37.203
Squarepants!
方裤！

00:39.873 --> 00:41.958
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.922 --> 00:53.720
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.813 --> 01:04.814
Ah.
啊。

01:13.573 --> 01:14.574
Hey, Patrick.
嘿，帕特里克。

01:14.657 --> 01:16.284
Hey, Spongebob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

01:16.367 --> 01:17.368
All ready to go
jellyfishing today?
一切准备就绪，出发
今天钓水母吗？

01:17.452 --> 01:18.787
No.
不。

01:18.870 --> 01:19.788
Just kidding!
只是在开玩笑！

01:23.333 --> 01:25.126
I see you even brought
your double net.
我看你还带来了
你的双网。

01:25.210 --> 01:27.587
Yep, it's three times as fun.
是的，它的乐趣是原来的三倍。

01:27.670 --> 01:29.422
Uh, Patrick,
don't you mean twice as fun?
呃，帕特里克，
你不是说乐趣加倍吗？

01:29.506 --> 01:30.590
What is?
什么是？

01:30.673 --> 01:32.258
Your--never mind.
你的——没关系。

01:32.342 --> 01:34.052
Oh, Spongebob,
that reminds me.
哦，海绵宝宝，
这让我想起了。

01:34.135 --> 01:37.263
We should probably check
the weather report before we go.
我们或许应该检查一下
出发前的天气预报。

01:37.347 --> 01:39.599
Good idea.
好主意。

01:39.682 --> 01:41.518
And now the weather.
现在是天气。

01:41.601 --> 01:42.852
Here we go.
开始了。

01:42.936 --> 01:44.395
Thank you, Phil.
谢谢你，菲尔。

01:44.479 --> 01:46.940
Today's weather forecast
calls for...
今天的天气预报
呼吁...

01:47.023 --> 01:50.360
A horrible storm will
ravage the Bikini Bottom area.
一场可怕的风暴将会
蹂躏比基尼区。

01:50.443 --> 01:52.320
Both: A horrible storm?
两人：一场可怕的风暴？

01:52.403 --> 01:53.488
You heard me.
你听到了。

01:53.571 --> 01:55.114
Panic is not advised,
不建议恐慌，

01:55.198 --> 01:57.450
although it is recommended.
虽然是推荐的。

01:57.534 --> 01:59.619
Also, an advisory
has been issued
另外，还有一个咨询
已发出

01:59.702 --> 02:03.957
to avoid any and all
jellyfishing if possible.
以避免任何和所有
如果可以的话，可以钓水母。

02:04.040 --> 02:06.501
Patrick, help me
get these boards nailed up.
帕特里克，帮帮我
把这些木板钉起来。

02:06.584 --> 02:09.212
Spongebob,
this seems like a strange time
海绵宝宝，
这似乎是一个奇怪的时刻

02:09.295 --> 02:11.131
to start decorating.
开始装饰。

02:11.214 --> 02:12.882
Start dec--
十二月开始——

02:12.966 --> 02:15.385
You, sir, obviously do not
recognize fine decorating
先生，您显然不
认识精美装饰

02:15.468 --> 02:18.930
when you see it.
当你看到它时。

02:19.013 --> 02:20.181
Hmm.
唔。

02:20.265 --> 02:21.891
Admire it later, Patrick.
稍后欣赏它，帕特里克。

02:21.975 --> 02:23.893
Right now, we've got to get
my house converted
现在，我们必须得到
我的房子改建了

02:23.977 --> 02:25.520
into a shelter capable
of withstanding extreme weather.
进入有能力的庇护所
能够承受极端天气。

02:25.603 --> 02:26.938
You can say that again.
你可以再说一遍。

02:27.021 --> 02:28.022
Actually, I can't.
事实上，我不能。

02:28.106 --> 02:29.732
Why?
为什么？

02:29.816 --> 02:32.527
Because I just stepped
on one of these nails.
因为我刚刚迈出一步
在其中一个指甲上。

02:32.610 --> 02:33.987
♪ La-da-di
la-da-dum ♪
♪ 拉达迪
拉达杜姆 ♪

02:34.070 --> 02:35.238
♪ La-da-doo ♪
♪ 拉达杜 ♪

02:35.321 --> 02:37.490
Got ya.
明白了。

02:37.574 --> 02:42.996
Now just one quick
flick of the wrist and...
现在只需快速一点
手腕一抖，然后……

02:43.079 --> 02:44.122
Boom!
繁荣！

02:45.582 --> 02:49.252
Oh, ho, blah.
哦，嗬，废话。

02:51.588 --> 02:52.714
Violin.
小提琴。

02:52.797 --> 02:54.507
Whoo, nice work, buddy.
哇，干得好，伙计。

02:54.591 --> 02:56.092
Now my house can withstand
现在我的房子可以承受

02:56.175 --> 02:57.510
anything nature has
to throw at us.
大自然拥有的任何东西
向我们扔。

02:59.262 --> 03:01.848
I guess Squidward's
我猜是章鱼哥

03:01.931 --> 03:03.850
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

03:03.933 --> 03:06.144
Did you come to weather out
the storm with us?
你是来避暑的吗
风暴与我们同在吗？

03:06.227 --> 03:07.812
No!
I--what storm?
不！
我——什么风暴？

03:07.896 --> 03:09.397
The one Phil Preflumster
told us about.
菲尔·普雷弗鲁斯特 (Phil Preflumster)
告诉我们。

03:09.480 --> 03:11.065
Who's that?
那是谁？

03:11.149 --> 03:12.317
He's the weatherman
on the news channel.
他是天气预报员
在新闻频道上。

03:12.400 --> 03:13.985
He said--
他说——

03:14.068 --> 03:15.737
I can't understand
a word you're saying.
我不明白
你说的一句话。

03:15.820 --> 03:17.864
Come on, Squidward.
It'll be fun.
来吧，章鱼哥。
会很有趣的。

03:17.947 --> 03:20.199
While the elements rage outside,
当外面的天气肆虐时，

03:20.283 --> 03:22.327
we'll snuggle in here
and pass the time
我们会依偎在这里
并打发时间

03:22.410 --> 03:26.831
by playing board games
and playing Tic-Tac-Toe
通过玩棋盘游戏
和玩井字游戏

03:26.915 --> 03:29.542
and drinking hot cocoa
和喝热可可

03:29.626 --> 03:32.170
and playing Tic-Tac-Toe
和玩井字游戏

03:32.253 --> 03:38.051
and doing jigsaw puzzles
and watching TV
和做拼图游戏
和看电视

03:38.134 --> 03:43.556
and drinking hot cocoa
and doing jigsaw puzzles
和喝热可可
和做拼图游戏

03:43.640 --> 03:45.850
and playing board games
和玩棋盘游戏

03:45.934 --> 03:48.311
and drinking hot tea.
并喝热茶。

03:48.394 --> 03:49.395
I thought it was cocoa!
我还以为是可可呢！

03:49.479 --> 03:50.897
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

03:50.980 --> 03:54.943
Hot cocoa...
We'll be drinking.
热可可...
我们会喝酒。

03:55.026 --> 03:56.611
That's better.
这样更好。

03:56.694 --> 03:59.072
Well, I think I'll pass.
嗯，我想我会通过。

03:59.155 --> 04:02.116
Even if I let you borrow my
huggly, snuggly bunny slippers?
就算我让你借我的
拥抱、舒适的兔子拖鞋？

04:02.200 --> 04:05.578
Hmm, I'll have
to think about that.
嗯，我会有
想想这个。

04:05.662 --> 04:07.413
Okay,
but you better think fast,
好吧，
但你最好快速思考，

04:07.497 --> 04:09.582
'cause Patrick here
really loves my--
因为帕特里克在这里
真的很爱我的——

04:14.295 --> 04:15.880
Squidward, welcome back!
章鱼哥，欢迎回来！

04:15.964 --> 04:17.674
Here's your slippers.
这是你的拖鞋。

04:20.385 --> 04:21.594
There.
That's better.
那里。
这样更好。

04:21.678 --> 04:23.179
What's better about it?
它有什么更好的呢？

04:23.262 --> 04:25.473
I liked it better before,
when I could see.
以前比较喜欢
当我能看见的时候。

04:25.556 --> 04:27.100
Squidward,
the lights went off.
章鱼哥，
灯灭了。

04:27.183 --> 04:28.226
Yes, they did,
是的，他们做到了，

04:28.309 --> 04:29.519
when you turned them off.
当你关闭它们时。

04:32.105 --> 04:33.398
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

04:33.481 --> 04:35.024
Patrick!
What is it?
帕特里克！
它是什么？

04:35.108 --> 04:37.819
I never realized
how delicious your hot cocoa is.
我从来没有意识到
你的热可可多美味啊。

04:37.902 --> 04:39.612
Oh, thank you, Patrick.
哦，谢谢你，帕特里克。

04:39.696 --> 04:41.281
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

04:41.364 --> 04:42.991
How about some of those games
you promised?
其中一些游戏怎么样
你答应了吗？

04:46.119 --> 04:48.454
Okay, boys, let's roll
to see who goes first.
好吧，孩子们，我们滚吧
看看谁先走。

04:48.538 --> 04:50.039
This is Tic-Tac-Toe.
这就是井字游戏。

04:50.123 --> 04:51.541
You don't roll
to see who goes first.
你不滚
看看谁先走。

04:51.624 --> 04:53.042
He's right.
他是对的。

04:53.126 --> 04:55.003
You play rock-paper-scissors
for it.
你玩石头剪刀布
为了它。

04:55.086 --> 04:58.548
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

04:58.631 --> 04:59.799
One.
一。

04:59.882 --> 05:02.510
-Two.
-Three.
-二。
-三。

05:02.593 --> 05:04.178
Oh, it's a tie.
哦，是领带。

05:04.262 --> 05:05.722
Darn it!
该死的！

05:05.805 --> 05:08.516
All: One, two, three.
全体：一、二、三。

05:08.599 --> 05:09.726
Darn it!
该死的！

05:09.809 --> 05:11.394
I'll get you next time.
下次我来接你。

05:11.477 --> 05:13.396
-One, two, three.
-Tie.
-一二三。
-领带。

05:13.479 --> 05:15.189
-Darn it!
-One, two--
-该死！
-一，二--

05:15.273 --> 05:17.692
-Tie.
-Darn it!
-领带。
-该死！

05:17.775 --> 05:19.861
There, I win.
See?
在那里，我赢了。
看？

05:19.944 --> 05:21.946
Hmm.
唔。

05:22.030 --> 05:23.865
I'm not seeing
anything there.
我没看到
那里有什么东西。

05:23.948 --> 05:26.075
Yeah, looks like
a lot of junk.
是的，看起来像
很多垃圾。

05:26.159 --> 05:28.036
What do you mean,
you're not seeing anything?
你是什么意思，
你什么都没看到吗？

05:28.119 --> 05:30.288
There's three in a row
right here.
连续三个
就在这里。

05:30.371 --> 05:32.582
Tic-Tac-Toe!
井字游戏！

05:32.665 --> 05:33.833
Easy, friend.
简单，朋友。

05:33.916 --> 05:35.293
Yeah, relax, Squidward.
是的，放松点，章鱼哥。

05:35.376 --> 05:38.671
We're just here to have fun.
我们只是来这里玩得开心。

05:38.755 --> 05:41.674
Oh, okay, yeah, okay.
哦，好吧，是啊，好吧。

05:41.758 --> 05:42.967
Here we go.
开始了。

05:43.051 --> 05:44.677
Congratulations, Squidward.
恭喜你，章鱼哥。

05:44.761 --> 05:47.346
Well played.
打的好。

05:49.223 --> 05:51.184
Come on, Patrick.
You can do it.
来吧，帕特里克。
你可以做到的。

05:52.477 --> 05:55.730
Be the puzzle piece.
成为拼图。

05:55.813 --> 06:01.444
Cannot complete
无法完成

06:01.527 --> 06:05.031
Difficulty level
too advanced.
难度级别
太先进了。

06:05.114 --> 06:12.705
Rate of brain activity
increasing aging process
大脑活动率
老化过程加剧

06:12.789 --> 06:18.711
by 30 years per second.
每秒 30 年。

06:18.795 --> 06:20.713
Come on, grandpa.
You can do it.
来吧，爷爷。
你可以做到的。

06:20.797 --> 06:22.673
You still got a few good years
left in you.
你还有好几年的时间
留在你里面。

06:22.757 --> 06:24.008
Eh?
呃？

06:24.092 --> 06:25.468
Go, Patrick!
Go!
去吧，帕特里克！
去！

06:25.551 --> 06:26.761
Go, Patrick!
Go!
去吧，帕特里克！
去！

06:26.844 --> 06:28.262
Go, Patrick!
Go!
去吧，帕特里克！
去！

06:28.346 --> 06:29.305
Go, Patrick!
Go!
去吧，帕特里克！
去！

06:30.723 --> 06:31.808
Go, Patrick!
Go!
去吧，帕特里克！
去！

06:31.891 --> 06:33.601
I told you creatures
我告诉过你生物

06:33.684 --> 06:35.895
I was trying to take a nap
over here.
我正想小睡一会儿
在这里。

06:35.978 --> 06:37.730
Now, for the last time,
can't you just--
现在，最后一次，
你不能只是——

06:37.814 --> 06:39.232
Hang on, Squidward.
坚持住，章鱼哥。

06:39.315 --> 06:41.067
Patrick was just about
to figure out
帕特里克正要
弄清楚

06:41.150 --> 06:42.610
where the last piece
of this puzzle goes.
最后一块在哪里
这个谜题的答案是。

06:42.693 --> 06:44.362
Weren't you, Patrick?
不是你吗，帕特里克？

06:44.445 --> 06:45.905
Who's the green guy?
绿衣人是谁？

06:45.988 --> 06:48.074
It's the last piece
of the puzzle!
这是最后一块
的谜题！

06:48.157 --> 06:49.742
There's only one place
it can go.
只有一个地方
它可以走了。

06:49.826 --> 06:51.577
Right here!
就在这里！

06:54.789 --> 06:56.415
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

06:56.499 --> 06:58.167
It wasn't your turn.
还没轮到你。

06:58.251 --> 06:59.335
That's cheating.
那是作弊。

06:59.418 --> 07:00.503
Cheating?
作弊？

07:00.586 --> 07:01.629
It's a jigsaw puzzle.
这是一个拼图游戏。

07:01.712 --> 07:03.089
You can't cheat.
你不能作弊。

07:03.172 --> 07:04.048
Oh, it's okay.
哦，没关系。

07:04.132 --> 07:05.591
We'll just start over.
我们就重新开始吧。

07:07.510 --> 07:09.387
I got to get out of here!
我必须离开这里！

07:14.851 --> 07:16.936
Oh, welcome back,
Squidward.
哦，欢迎回来，
章鱼哥。

07:17.019 --> 07:18.646
We were right about
to start figuring out
我们是对的
开始弄清楚

07:18.729 --> 07:20.731
where this first
puzzle piece goes.
这是第一个
拼图块消失了。

07:20.815 --> 07:22.400
Oh, maybe Squidward
can help us--
哦，也许章鱼哥
可以帮助我们——

07:22.483 --> 07:23.568
No, he can't.
不，他不能。

07:23.651 --> 07:25.111
Please, Squidward?
请问，章鱼哥？

07:25.194 --> 07:27.822
-No way.
-Please.
-决不。
-请。

07:27.905 --> 07:30.950
I have an even better idea.
我有一个更好的主意。

07:31.033 --> 07:32.535
-What is it?
-Yeah, tell us.
-这是什么？
-是的，告诉我们。

07:32.618 --> 07:34.078
Tell us. Tell us.
Tell us.
告诉我们。告诉我们。
告诉我们。

07:34.162 --> 07:35.580
Tell us. Tell us. Tell us.
Tell--
告诉我们。告诉我们。告诉我们。
告诉 -

07:35.663 --> 07:37.456
Shh.
Quiet time.
嘘。
安静的时间。

07:37.540 --> 07:41.460
It's a game called Boundaries.
这是一个叫《边界》的游戏。

07:41.544 --> 07:42.879
Ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh.
Ooh.
哦，哦哦哦。
哦。

07:42.962 --> 07:44.463
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

07:44.547 --> 07:47.592
Uh, will there be
any spelling in this game?
呃，会有吗
这游戏有拼写吗？

07:47.675 --> 07:49.302
Oh, no.
No spelling.
哦，不。
没有拼写。

07:49.385 --> 07:50.428
Yes!
是的！

07:50.511 --> 07:51.846
It's very simple.
这很简单。

07:51.929 --> 07:53.681
The object of the game
游戏的对象

07:53.764 --> 07:58.019
is to see how long everyone
can leave Squidward alone.
就是看大家多久
可以让章鱼哥独自一人。

07:58.102 --> 07:59.979
Until the storm passes,
直到暴风雨过去，

08:00.062 --> 08:02.356
he will stay
inside boundaries
他会留下来
边界内

08:02.440 --> 08:06.235
he defines with chalk lines
on the floor.
他用粉笔线定义
在地板上。

08:06.319 --> 08:08.237
-I have a question.
-What?
-我有一个问题。
-什么？

08:08.321 --> 08:10.281
Where are you gonna get
the chalk?
你要去哪里
粉笔？

08:10.364 --> 08:14.035
I brought some!
我带了一些！

08:17.371 --> 08:18.831
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:31.219 --> 08:33.471
Brilliant work, as usual,
Squidward.
一如既往的出色工作，
章鱼哥。

08:33.554 --> 08:35.139
Now all I have to do
现在我要做的就是

08:35.223 --> 08:36.933
is sit here
until this storm blows over.
坐在这里
直到这场风暴过去。

08:38.768 --> 08:40.645
Wait a minute.
I'm starving.
等一下。
我饿死了。

08:40.728 --> 08:46.234
Spongebob's got to have
some snacks in here somewhere.
海绵宝宝必须有
这里有一些小吃。

08:46.317 --> 08:48.861
Ah, jackpot.
啊，中奖了。

08:54.617 --> 08:59.705
I bet you wish you had
some of this, don't--
我打赌你希望你有
其中一些，不要——

08:59.789 --> 09:00.873
Snail food?
蜗牛食物？

09:00.957 --> 09:04.710
Blah!
废话！

09:04.794 --> 09:07.546
I got to find
some real food.
我必须找到
一些真正的食物。

09:07.630 --> 09:09.215
Maybe in the kitchen...
也许在厨房里...

09:09.298 --> 09:10.466
Halt!
停止！

09:10.549 --> 09:12.301
Nobody is to cross
this boundary.
没有人可以跨越
这个边界。

09:12.385 --> 09:14.136
I'm the one
who drew this line
我就是那个
这条线是谁画的

09:14.220 --> 09:16.055
you're not supposed to cross.
你不应该穿越。

09:16.138 --> 09:17.890
If you are the one
who drew it,
如果你是那个人
谁画的，

09:17.974 --> 09:19.517
let me see
your identification papers.
让我看看
您的身份证件。

09:19.600 --> 09:20.935
Identifi--
Fine.
身份识别--
很好。

09:21.018 --> 09:22.436
But when this storm is over,
但当这场风暴结束后

09:22.520 --> 09:24.522
you're gonna regret this,
mister.
你会后悔的
先生。

09:24.605 --> 09:26.399
What the--what?
I don't have them.
什么——什么？
我没有。

09:26.482 --> 09:28.401
They must be
in my other pants.
他们一定是
在我的另一条裤子里。

09:28.484 --> 09:31.070
Look, if you just let me cross,
I can go and get them.
听着 如果你让我过去
我可以去接他们。

09:31.153 --> 09:32.863
Please, I promise I'll--
拜托，我保证我会——

09:32.947 --> 09:35.574
Hmm, you may be
telling the truth.
嗯，你可能是
说实话。

09:35.658 --> 09:37.576
Oh, thank you.
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.
哦，谢谢。
谢谢。谢谢。谢谢。

09:37.660 --> 09:39.078
I'm just so hungry--
我只是太饿了——

09:39.161 --> 09:40.913
But then again,
you may not.
但话又说回来，
你可能不会。

09:40.997 --> 09:43.082
Come with me.
We shall find out the truth.
跟我来吧。
我们将会找出真相。

09:43.165 --> 09:45.376
Ooh, that'll be the day.
噢，那一天就会到来。

09:49.505 --> 09:51.549
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:51.632 --> 09:53.843
Stop that cephalopod!
阻止那个头足类动物！

09:53.926 --> 09:55.261
Hiyoh!
嗨哟！

09:55.344 --> 09:57.096
Please.
请。

09:57.179 --> 10:01.058
I just want to get back
onto my side of the boundary.
我只想回来
到我这边的边界。

10:01.142 --> 10:02.768
This, I cannot allow.
这，我不能允许。

10:02.852 --> 10:04.437
It is against the rules.
这是违反规则的。

10:04.520 --> 10:07.440
But all I wanted
was something to eat.
但我想要的一切
是吃的东西。

10:07.523 --> 10:08.899
Did somebody say
something to eat?
有人说过吗
有什么吃的吗？

10:13.863 --> 10:15.573
My food!
我的食物！

10:15.656 --> 10:17.158
Your food?
你的食物？

10:17.241 --> 10:19.118
Hey, I want some too.
嘿嘿，我也想要一些。

10:33.966 --> 10:35.593
Wah, wow.
哇，哇。

10:49.106 --> 10:51.567
Is this really
what we've come to?
这真的是吗
我们到了什么程度？

10:51.650 --> 10:54.028
Is one little storm
all it takes
是一场小风暴
所需要的一切

10:54.111 --> 10:56.906
to turn us
into complete animals?
来改变我们
变成完整的动物？

10:56.989 --> 10:58.699
Apparently so.
显然是这样。

10:58.783 --> 11:01.994
Well, that and a refrigerator
full of food, anyways.
嗯，还有一个冰箱
反正吃饱了

11:02.078 --> 11:05.039
Hey, did you hear that?
嘿，你听到了吗？

11:05.122 --> 11:07.375
Oh, it's just Patrick
哦，这只是帕特里克

11:07.458 --> 11:08.709
No, no, no, no,
not that.
不，不，不，不，
不是那个。

11:08.793 --> 11:10.002
I mean from outside.
我的意思是从外面。

11:10.086 --> 11:11.337
I don't hear anything.
我什么也没听到。

11:11.420 --> 11:13.172
The storm must have stopped.
暴风雨应该已经停止了。

11:13.255 --> 11:14.382
Squidward, wait!
章鱼哥，等等！

11:14.465 --> 11:16.008
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

11:16.092 --> 11:18.719
So long, suckers!
再见，傻瓜们！

11:22.473 --> 11:24.183
Boom!
繁荣！

11:24.266 --> 11:26.560
Curse you, Preflumster.
诅咒你，Preflumster。

11:31.190 --> 11:38.864
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:41.117 --> 11:42.576
And good riddance.
祝你摆脱困境。

11:42.660 --> 11:44.245
Next time,
you should read the sign
下次，
你应该阅读这个标志

11:44.328 --> 11:47.706
about our mandatory
side of fries policy.
关于我们的强制性
薯条政策的一面。

11:47.790 --> 11:50.584
Lookee, another bright-eyed,
bushy-tailed customer.
看，另一个眼睛明亮的人，
浓密尾巴的顾客。

11:50.668 --> 11:52.086
But I--
But I don't--
但我——
但我不——

11:52.169 --> 11:53.379
Want to stop spending money
here?
想要停止花钱
在这里？

11:53.462 --> 11:55.172
Well, don't worry.
好吧，别担心。

11:55.256 --> 11:57.007
I'm certainly not gonna keep you
from doing what you want.
我当然不会挽留你
从做你想做的事。

11:57.091 --> 11:58.384
Give him a Krabby Patty
with the works.
给他一个蟹肉饼
与作品。

11:58.467 --> 11:59.427
I'm not hungry.
我不饿。

12:00.803 --> 12:02.721
Oh, that's funny.
哦，这很有趣。

12:02.805 --> 12:06.058
I'll think about that one
while you buy some club soda.
我会考虑一下那个
当你买一些苏打水时。

12:06.142 --> 12:08.102
Boy, you're doing it
all wrong.
男孩，你正在做这事
都错了。

12:08.185 --> 12:10.062
Here, take this.
给，拿着这个。

12:10.146 --> 12:12.064
Now you can flip two patties
at the same time,
现在你可以翻转两个肉饼了
同时，

12:12.148 --> 12:13.065
do twice the work.
做两倍的工作。

12:16.652 --> 12:19.113
Mr. Krabs, you're a--
蟹老板，你是——

12:19.196 --> 12:20.406
Genius?
Perhaps.
天才？
也许。

12:20.489 --> 12:23.993
Or maybe I'm just a little off.
或者也许我只是有点偏离。

12:24.076 --> 12:26.495
Wow.
If only I was a little off.
哇。
如果我稍微偏离一点就好了。

12:26.579 --> 12:28.330
Are you gonna
let me out of here?
你要吗
让我离开这里吗？

12:32.585 --> 12:34.378
The formula.
公式。

12:34.462 --> 12:36.172
Blasted flimsy nails.
脆弱的指甲被炸毁。

12:36.255 --> 12:38.799
How am I supposed to hide
me formula in this nonsense?
我该如何隐藏
我这个废话的公式？

12:38.883 --> 12:42.595
Oh, well,
it's the life I choose to live.
哦，好吧，
这是我选择的生活。

12:50.686 --> 12:52.271
Did you see that?
你看到了吗？

12:52.354 --> 12:54.982
Yeah, Krabs hides his formula
under the floor.
是的，蟹老板隐藏了他的配方
在地板下。

12:55.065 --> 12:56.025
So what?
所以呢？

12:56.108 --> 12:57.485
So everything!
所以一切！

12:57.568 --> 12:59.612
That means I know
where it is.
这意味着我知道
它在哪里。

12:59.695 --> 13:01.280
Doesn't mean
you can get to it.
并不意味着
你可以做到的。

13:01.363 --> 13:02.740
What kind of wife...
什么样的老婆...

13:02.823 --> 13:04.700
We'll see about that.
我们将会看到这一点。

13:10.873 --> 13:13.083
I knew this baby
would come in handy.
我认识这个宝贝
会派上用场的。

13:13.167 --> 13:14.627
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

13:14.710 --> 13:16.128
Turn on
the navigation system, honey.
打开
导航系统，亲爱的。

13:16.212 --> 13:18.422
Let's get this show
on the road.
让我们来看看这个节目
在路上。

13:18.506 --> 13:20.716
Dig 50 meters.
Then turn right.
挖50米。
然后右转。

13:26.847 --> 13:29.433
At this rate, we'll have
the formula before you can say--
按照这个速度，我们将有
公式之前你可以说——

13:32.520 --> 13:33.354
Barnacles!
藤壶！

13:33.437 --> 13:35.022
Now what?
现在怎么办？

13:35.105 --> 13:37.149
It appears we've stumbled
into a mishap.
看来我们被绊倒了
陷入不幸。

13:37.233 --> 13:40.653
Now we're stuck between a rock
and a hard place, literally.
现在我们被困在岩石之间
从字面上看，这是一个艰难的地方。

13:40.736 --> 13:44.698
Well, let's just dig deeper
and go around it.
好吧，让我们深入挖掘一下
并绕过它。

13:44.782 --> 13:46.325
Uh, the only problem
with that is--
呃，唯一的问题
那就是——

13:46.408 --> 13:47.868
Shh!
嘘！

13:47.952 --> 13:49.370
Can't you see
I'm concentrating?
你看不到吗
我专心了？

13:53.123 --> 13:54.250
Yes!
是的！

13:54.333 --> 13:55.668
Do you see what happens
你看到发生了什么吗

13:55.751 --> 13:56.919
when you let me make
my own decisions?
当你让我做
我自己的决定？

13:57.002 --> 13:58.629
Now maybe we'll get some--
现在也许我们会得到一些——

14:04.635 --> 14:06.095
What happened?
发生了什么？

14:06.178 --> 14:07.596
Well, right before
you started
嗯，就在之前
你开始了

14:07.680 --> 14:09.557
making your own decisions,
自己做决定，

14:09.640 --> 14:13.143
I was about to say we're digging
right above an underground cave.
我正想说我们正在挖掘
就在一个地下洞穴的上方。

14:15.938 --> 14:20.025
Oh, the majesty.
哦，陛下。

14:24.113 --> 14:27.241
I've never seen such beauty.
我从未见过如此美丽。

14:29.827 --> 14:34.039
Sad, sob, cry, sob.
悲伤，哭泣，哭泣，哭泣。

14:34.123 --> 14:37.251
It's such a shame
no one else can see it.
真是太可惜了
其他人都看不到它。

14:37.334 --> 14:38.877
Sad.
Ding!
伤心。
叮！

14:38.961 --> 14:40.921
Plankton, I think I know
浮游生物，我想我知道

14:41.005 --> 14:43.173
how we can push Krabs
out of business.
我们如何推动蟹蟹
破产了。

14:43.257 --> 14:45.384
We'll lure the customers
underground
我们会吸引顾客
地下

14:45.467 --> 14:47.803
with this gorgeous scenery.
伴随着这绚丽的风景。

14:47.886 --> 14:49.346
Karen, please.
凯伦，请。

14:49.430 --> 14:53.267
I'm trying to process
my emotions.
我正在尝试处理
我的情绪。

14:53.350 --> 14:55.227
Karen, I think I know
凯伦，我想我知道

14:55.311 --> 14:57.313
how we can push Krabs
out of business.
我们如何推动蟹蟹
破产了。

14:57.396 --> 14:59.481
We'll lure the customers
underground
我们会吸引顾客
地下

14:59.565 --> 15:00.566
with this gorgeous scenery!
有了这美丽的风景！

15:01.692 --> 15:02.943
Man, I'm good!
伙计，我很好！

15:06.864 --> 15:10.743
Cave dwellers!
穴居人！

15:10.826 --> 15:11.952
Whoa!
哇！

15:16.123 --> 15:18.334
Get back!
回来吧！

15:20.669 --> 15:22.171
That's better.
这样更好。

15:22.254 --> 15:24.923
From now on,
you shall be my minions,
从现在开始，
你将成为我的奴才，

15:25.007 --> 15:27.509
servants to follow
my every order.
仆人跟随
我的每一个订单。

15:27.593 --> 15:31.805
I decree this kingdom
to be called the Chum Caverns,
我下令这个王国
被称为楚姆洞穴，

15:31.889 --> 15:33.599
and may the people
of Bikini Bottom
愿人民
比基尼下装

15:33.682 --> 15:36.435
shudder in awe of its majesty.
对其威严感到敬畏。

15:40.648 --> 15:42.358
Hurry up, mom.
快点，妈妈。

15:42.441 --> 15:45.402
I want to see the Chum Caverns
before the line gets too long.
我想去看看密姆洞穴
在队伍变得太长之前。

15:45.486 --> 15:46.695
Never you mind, Suzy.
没关系，苏西。

15:46.779 --> 15:48.781
It's already too late for that.
已经太晚了。

15:48.864 --> 15:50.824
Quick,
get in front of that kid.
快点，
走到那个孩子面前。

15:50.908 --> 15:53.035
This is my spot.
这是我的地盘。

16:03.671 --> 16:06.465
Splat!
啪！

16:08.258 --> 16:10.594
You know, this stuff
is hideously inedible,
你知道，这个东西
是极其不可食用的，

16:10.678 --> 16:12.262
but your decor is so amazing,
但你的装饰太棒了

16:12.346 --> 16:14.181
I can't resist
spending my money here.
我无法抗拒
把我的钱花在这里。

16:18.477 --> 16:19.853
Two orders of Chum Nuggets,
please.
两份 Chum Nuggets 订单，
请。

16:23.941 --> 16:25.984
That certainly is chum,
那当然是密友，

16:26.068 --> 16:28.529
and such steamy chumminess
deserves recompense.
和如此热气腾腾的亲密关系
值得报应。

16:28.612 --> 16:30.531
Oh, I'll take that.
哦，我会接受的。

16:30.614 --> 16:34.993
Eat your twisted, blackened,
moneygrubbing heart out, Krabs.
吃掉你扭曲的、变黑的，
蟹蟹们，贪图金钱的心。

16:35.077 --> 16:38.497
I'm even profiting
off your most loyal ally.
我还盈利了
离开你最忠实的盟友。

16:41.917 --> 16:44.169
I'm running out of space
for this stuff.
我的空间不足了
对于这个东西。

16:44.253 --> 16:47.256
Got an empty safe
I can borrow, Krabs?
有一个空的保险箱
我可以借用吗，蟹蟹？

16:49.383 --> 16:51.510
But seriously,
this is getting really heavy.
但说真的，
这真的变得很沉重。

16:59.393 --> 17:01.854
Patrick,
isn't this place amazing?
帕特里克，
这个地方不是很棒吗？

17:06.775 --> 17:08.235
Here's your Chum Nuggets,
buddy.
这是你的密友金块，
伙计。

17:10.738 --> 17:12.781
Your Chum Kabob.
你的密友烤肉。

17:12.865 --> 17:16.452
Uh, I guess you don't come
down here for the food, anyway.
呃，我猜你不会来
无论如何，来这里是为了食物。

17:16.535 --> 17:18.996
You come down here to admire
the subterranean splendor
你来这里欣赏
地下的辉煌

17:19.079 --> 17:20.831
of the Chum Caverns.
楚姆洞穴。

17:20.914 --> 17:23.083
That and the gift shop.
那和礼品店。

17:23.167 --> 17:25.794
Ooh, that's right, Patrick.
The gift shop!
哦，没错，帕特里克。
礼品店！

17:38.474 --> 17:42.519
Yeah, baby.
I've got cavern fever!
是的，宝贝。
我得了洞穴热！

17:42.603 --> 17:44.188
Where have you been?
你去哪儿了？

17:44.271 --> 17:45.564
And what's that ridiculous thing
on your head?
那是什么可笑的事情
在你头上吗？

17:45.647 --> 17:47.399
It's a Stalag-Miter.
这是一个石塔尖顶。

17:47.483 --> 17:49.777
Available exclusively
at the Chum Caverns gift shop.
独家发售
在 Chum Caverns 礼品店。

17:49.860 --> 17:52.571
How dare you spend
all the money I don't pay you
你怎么敢花钱
所有的钱我都不付给你

17:52.654 --> 17:54.323
at me archrival's business?
关我宿敌的事？

17:54.406 --> 17:56.575
Boy, Plankton's really
cleaning up down there,
男孩，浮游生物真的
清理那里，

17:56.658 --> 17:59.661
which means the only way
to pick this business up
这意味着唯一的方法
接手这项业务

17:59.745 --> 18:02.206
is to run it into the ground.
就是把它埋到地下。

18:02.289 --> 18:04.958
Another order of Chum Balls.
又一份密友球。

18:06.794 --> 18:07.753
Huh?
啊？

18:10.839 --> 18:11.924
Krabs?
螃蟹？

18:12.007 --> 18:13.425
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？

18:13.509 --> 18:16.470
I'm here to steal back
me customers
我是来偷回来的
我的顾客

18:16.553 --> 18:20.098
with the savory flavor
of a Krabby Patty.
带着咸味
蟹肉饼。

18:20.182 --> 18:22.100
Now, go get it.
现在，去拿吧。

18:26.647 --> 18:27.815
Krabs!
螃蟹们！

18:27.898 --> 18:29.691
You can't just slither down here
你不能就这么滑下去

18:29.775 --> 18:31.652
and steal all my customers.
并抢走我所有的顾客。

18:31.735 --> 18:32.861
It's unethical.
这是不道德的。

18:32.945 --> 18:34.112
Unethical?
不道德？

18:34.196 --> 18:35.823
This is all perfectly legit.
这都是完全合法的。

18:35.906 --> 18:38.158
I call full drilling rights
under me restaurant.
我称之为完全钻探权
我下面的餐厅。

18:38.242 --> 18:40.577
Sea turtles!
He called it.
海龟！
他这样称呼它。

18:40.661 --> 18:42.871
He always was good
with legal jargon.
他一直都很好
用法律术语。

18:42.955 --> 18:44.540
All right, Krabs,
好吧，蟹蟹们，

18:44.623 --> 18:47.209
if you think it's fair
to undercut my business,
如果你认为这是公平的
削弱我的生意，

18:47.292 --> 18:51.964
then I'm gonna undercut you.
那我就削弱你了

18:56.802 --> 18:58.929
How does it feel, Krabs,
蟹蟹感觉怎么样

18:59.012 --> 19:00.889
being in the hole,
so to speak?
处于洞中时，
可以这么说吗？

19:00.973 --> 19:02.933
Not well, I'd imagine.
不太好，我想。

19:03.016 --> 19:04.309
Now, hold still
so I can bury you.
现在，保持不动
这样我就可以埋葬你。

19:04.393 --> 19:08.397
Not if I bury you first.
如果我先埋葬你就不会。

19:08.480 --> 19:09.731
Eh?
呃？

19:15.112 --> 19:17.573
Fine, Krabs,
have it your way.
好吧，蟹蟹们，
随心所欲。

19:29.334 --> 19:30.836
Oh!
哦！

19:30.919 --> 19:32.045
Ah.
啊。

19:37.175 --> 19:39.803
We're trapped, trapped,
trapped, I tell you!
我们被困住了，被困住了，
被困了，我告诉你！

19:39.887 --> 19:41.680
This is all your fault.
这都是你的错。

19:41.763 --> 19:44.141
I ought to boil and butter you
for this.
我应该把你煮沸并涂上黄油
为此。

19:44.224 --> 19:46.184
Plankton, I don't think
浮游生物，我不认为

19:46.268 --> 19:47.811
of our sitiation.
我们的情况。

19:47.895 --> 19:49.855
We're trapped down here,
我们被困在这里了

19:49.938 --> 19:53.901
as in, there is no way out!
就像，没有出路！

19:53.984 --> 19:55.402
Ha!
哈!

19:55.485 --> 19:57.529
There may be
no way out for you, Krabs,
可能有
蟹蟹，你没有出路，

19:57.613 --> 20:00.032
but you needn't worry
about me.
但你不用担心
关于我。

20:00.115 --> 20:02.075
My diminutive stature
allows me
我的身材娇小
允许我

20:02.159 --> 20:06.997
to slip through rubble
with ease.
穿过瓦砾
轻松地。

20:08.206 --> 20:09.583
I can't make it.
我做不到。

20:09.666 --> 20:10.751
We're doomed!
我们注定了！

20:10.834 --> 20:12.377
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

20:12.461 --> 20:13.712
That's what I've been trying
to tell you.
这就是我一直在尝试的
告诉你。

20:21.219 --> 20:23.138
Comfort me.
安慰我。

20:27.935 --> 20:29.895
15 minutes later...
15分钟后...

20:33.565 --> 20:36.568
Ah, look at us.
Old, gray.
啊，看看我们。
旧的，灰色的。

20:36.652 --> 20:37.945
Nearing the end.
接近尾声了。

20:38.028 --> 20:39.571
Say, Plankton,
说，浮游生物，

20:39.655 --> 20:42.032
if we ever make it out of here
with our lives,
如果我们能离开这里
和我们的生活，

20:42.115 --> 20:45.035
let's agree to work together.
让我们同意一起工作。

20:45.118 --> 20:47.162
You're right, Krabs.
你说得对，蟹蟹。

20:47.245 --> 20:49.915
Let's bury the hatchet
now and forever.
让我们冰释前嫌吧
现在和永远。

20:49.998 --> 20:51.333
We have a deal.
我们达成协议。

20:51.416 --> 20:53.085
No more bickering.
不再争吵。

20:53.168 --> 20:55.921
No more skullduggery
of any kind.
不再有诈骗行为
任何类型的。

20:56.004 --> 20:57.255
Yeah.
是的。

20:57.339 --> 20:58.882
Hang on a minute.
等一下。

20:58.966 --> 20:59.883
Don't you hear that?
你没听到吗？

21:02.094 --> 21:03.595
Surprise!
惊喜！

21:03.679 --> 21:05.305
You found us, boy!
你找到了我们，孩子！

21:05.389 --> 21:07.641
Oh-ho!
I should pay you for this.
噢嗬！
我应该为此付钱给你。

21:07.724 --> 21:10.435
Or just pay me for the job
I already do.
或者只是付钱给我这份工作
我已经这样做了。

21:10.519 --> 21:13.146
Hey, Plankton,
we're free!
嘿，浮游生物，
我们自由了！

21:13.230 --> 21:14.439
Where'd he go?
他去哪儿了？

21:14.523 --> 21:16.024
I'm way ahead of you, Krabs.
我比你领先很多，蟹蟹。

21:17.901 --> 21:20.278
You better not be trying
to steal me formula.
你最好不要尝试
偷我的配方。

21:20.362 --> 21:22.948
I am, and I will.
我是，而且我会的。

21:23.031 --> 21:24.950
But what about our deal?
但我们的交易呢？

21:25.033 --> 21:26.827
What?
We're still working together.
什么？
我们仍然一起工作。

21:26.910 --> 21:29.830
Come on, you're helping me
steal your formula.
来吧，你在帮助我
窃取你的公式。

21:29.913 --> 21:31.289
That's it.
就是这样。

21:31.373 --> 21:35.002
Just wait till I get me claws
on you.
等我抓到我的爪子
在你身上。

21:35.085 --> 21:36.169
Ah!
啊!

21:36.253 --> 21:40.132
Now to get that formula.
现在得到这个公式。

22:00.569 --> 22:03.280
Satisfied with yourself,
Plankton?
对自己很满意，
浮游生物？

22:03.363 --> 22:05.407
Now you trapped us all
underground.
现在你困住了我们所有人
地下。

22:05.490 --> 22:07.409
But at least we're trapped
in a good restaurant.
但至少我们被困住了
在一家好餐馆里。

22:07.492 --> 22:09.327
Captive customers?
俘虏客户？

22:09.411 --> 22:11.163
I should have thought of this
sooner.
我应该想到这一点
早点。

22:11.246 --> 22:13.165
Hmm, but without Squidward,
嗯，但是没有章鱼哥，

22:13.248 --> 22:16.543
I need someone
to work the register.
我需要有人
操作寄存器。

22:26.344 --> 22:34.019
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪